    "body": "Merged current main (`884e7219`), which now has #383's machine-file editor. The two conflicts were module doc comments in `machine/library.rs` and `egui_app/machines_pane.rs`; both now describe the editor (#383) and \"Use for this setup\" (#384), plus main's new `use std::path::PathBuf`. Re-gated: ui lib machine tests 30, ui `tests/machine` 6, app `machine_library` 11, `machine` 32, `machine_edit` 12, `setup_mount` 6, `setup_mounts_post` 5, all passing; clippy app+ui clean. Fork synced at v0.15.0. Still a draft, waiting on the GUI check (the old `camcraft-ui-426` build predates the editor, so a fresh build is coming).",
